	 ('f3147237-512d-4189-ab17-74326f2c44f2','Air Jordan XXXIX PF','{"benefits":[{"header":"All play with no crash","body":["We added a crash pad at the instep to help hold your foot in place and keep your toes from slamming into the toe box. After all, just because MJ lost a few toenails, it doesn''t mean you should have to."]},{"header":"Zoom into comfort","body":["ZoomX foam, Nike''s lightest high-efficiency foam, contours to the natural shape of your foot to give you soft and springy cushioning without weighing you down. We paired it with a full-length Air Zoom unit for snappy energy return."]},{"header":"Rock solid","body":["Remember MJ''s cross step? Of course you do. It influenced this shoe from the sole up. A built-in sidewall cupsole helps provide stability during lateral movements and allows for full engagement of the underfoot cushioning."]}],"product_details":[{"header":"Product details","body":["PF edition is designed to fit wide for play on outdoor courts.","Colour Shown: Black/Sail","Style: FQ0214-001","Country/Region of Origin: Vietnam"]}]}','https://static.nike.com/a/images/c_limit,w_592,f_auto/t_product_v1/u_126ab356-44d8-4a06-89b4-fcdcc8df0245,c_scale,fl_relative,w_1.0,h_1.0,fl_layer_apply/c5583daa-464a-4172-a060-fd434277c05a/AIR+JORDAN+XXXIX+PF.png','599.74','2025-01-03 15:45:48.024159','2025-01-03 15:45:48.024159','basketball','men'),
