	 ('4971e199-c01e-44df-9ece-49516c06472e','Zion 3 PF','{"benefits":[{"header":"Lateral action","body":["Side to side, left to right. Traction on the outsole helps you grip the court with every step, while a foam carrier in the midsole adds support for your ankle and heel."]},{"header":"Up fast, down hard","body":["Nike Air helps you get those powerful ups when you blast off the court—and adds cushioning on re-entry."]},{"header":"Get low","body":["For improved ground feel, we dropped in some Formula 23 foam. It''s soft and responsive underfoot, helping you stay low in your movements."]}],"product_details":[{"header":"Product details","body":["PF edition is designed to fit wide for play on outdoor courts.","Colour Shown: Black/White/Pear/Light British Tan","Style: DR0676-002","Country/Region of Origin: Vietnam"]}]}','https://static.nike.com/a/images/c_limit,w_592,f_auto/t_product_v1/u_126ab356-44d8-4a06-89b4-fcdcc8df0245,c_scale,fl_relative,w_1.0,h_1.0,fl_layer_apply/0e7f58b6-1420-4a8c-b80e-ec4fd43506d4/JORDAN+ZION+3+PF.png','662.02','2025-01-03 15:45:48.04298','2025-01-03 15:45:48.04298','basketball','men'),
