	 ('caa45239-dc72-431c-9c3e-624448ea62c0','Nike React Phantom Run Flyknit 2','{"benefits":[{"header":"Smooth and Responsive","body":["Nike React technology delivers a soft, smooth, responsive ride. The shape of the foam midsole is all about zonal performance. It provides support for the 3 phases of a runner''s stride—flexibility at toe-off, a smooth ride at mid-stance and cushioning at contact."]},{"header":"Secure Feel","body":["The latest in Flywire technology features an elastic design that intertwines with the Flyknit upper, helping your foot feel secure as you run."]},{"header":"Lightweight and Breathable","body":["Flyknit Loft is the latest update to the popular material. 3 forefoot layers are combined for a lightweight, breathable and durable feel that keeps your foot comfortable."]}],"product_details":[{"header":"Product Details","body":["Increased rubber on the outsole helps deliver traction and durability.","Moulding around the heel keeps you secure so you can focus on your route.","Offset: 10mm (Forefoot: 18.5mm, Heel: 28.5mm)","Colour Shown: Black/White","Style: CJ0280-001","Country/Region of Origin: Vietnam"]}]}','https://static.nike.com/a/images/c_limit,w_592,f_auto/t_product_v1/i1-67c9863c-7abf-4b10-8e5c-2c773300d795/W+NIKE+REACT+PHANTOM+RUN+FK+2.png','725.81','2025-01-03 15:45:48.221831','2025-01-03 15:45:48.221831','running','women'),
	 ('0a4ecd73-7f42-47cf-b634-e253b475358d','Nike Streakfly','{"benefits":[{"header":"Low and nimble","body":["A full-length ZoomX midsole provides optimal lightweight responsiveness. The foam stack heights are lower than the Vaporfly, saving weight and giving you a more aggressive feel. It results in a shoe so light it disappears on your foot, while still giving you the responsive cushioning of ZoomX foam, helping you reach your fastest pace throughout the turns and accelerations of any race."]},{"header":"Supportive and sleek","body":["An ultra-thin knit upper is light in weight while still providing the support you need for racing. Extra reinforcement in the forefoot helps keep you secure. The updated, sleek lacing system is laterally offset with a notched tongue to help relieve pressure on the top of the foot."]},{"header":"Grip where it counts","body":["Runner-informed data was used to create the outsole. It uses that information to place traction where you need it the most, with a pattern that connects to the pavement based on how your foot hits the ground. The result is solid grip from foot contact to toe-off, helping you stay ahead of the competition."]}],"product_details":[{"header":"Product details","body":["Weight: Approx. 185g (men''s size 9)","Heel-to-toe drop: 6mm","Colour Shown: Pale Ivory/Guava Ice/Black","Style: DJ6566-105","Country/Region of Origin: Vietnam"]}]}','https://static.nike.com/a/images/c_limit,w_592,f_auto/t_product_v1/ba44f6c4-6413-42b6-a0c0-6fdfb22afa7b/NIKE+ZOOMX+STREAKFLY.png','725.74','2025-01-03 15:45:48.224366','2025-01-03 15:45:48.224366','running','women'),
	 ('046f6a08-db36-4f5e-85e5-0878df045cf1','Nike Pegasus Trail 5','{"benefits":[{"header":"Extra Cushioning","body":["Nike ReactX foam in the midsole gives you extra cushioning."]},{"header":"Breathable for your run","body":["We placed engineered mesh with tighter woven fabric in high-wear areas, like the toes. The engineered mesh is combined with open holes on the upper for breathability. Plus, Flywire technology integrates with the laces to help secure your midfoot."]},{"header":"All-direction traction","body":["Less rubber along the outsole compared to the previous iteration creates a smooth transition from road to trail while preserving the full-length ReactX midsole. Plus, it wraps around the front of the shoe to provide extra durability. A generative traction pattern combined with rubber in the forefoot provides extra grip for technical trails while maintaining a smooth ride for the road."]}],"product_details":[{"header":"Product details","body":["Weight: 243 grams approx. (women''s UK 6)","Heel-to-toe drop: 9.5mm","Not intended for use as personal protective equipment (PPE)","Colour Shown: Plum Dust/Platinum Violet/Beyond Pink/Metallic Silver","Style: DV3865-500","Country/Region of Origin: China"]}]}','https://static.nike.com/a/images/c_limit,w_592,f_auto/t_product_v1/9b1976e6-93eb-41f3-934d-858abacd24b7/W+NIKE+REACTX+PEGASUS+TRAIL+5.png','566.83','2025-01-03 15:45:48.225142','2025-01-03 15:45:48.225142','running','women'),
	 ('96126196-fbc2-4894-b505-5faed8ca77d0','Nike Vaporfly 3','{"benefits":[{"header":"Propelling you forwards","body":["A full-length carbon fibre flyplate provides a stiff and propulsive feel."]},{"header":"Speed for miles","body":["Nike ZoomX, our most responsive foam, just got a little better. Running from heel to toe, it unlocks even more energy return than before, giving you a springy, bouncy feel."]},{"header":"Stable ride","body":["See how the midsole bulges out by the heel? We designed it that way to help reduce weight on the inside of the foot to give you a more stable ride."]},{"header":"Feel the breeze","body":["Specifically selected Flyknit yarns and engineered zones in the forefoot bring a new level of performance to the Vaporfly. Ample breathability around the toes combined with soft, yet supportive yarns deliver our most customised upper for the Vaporfly. The result is a softer, cooler design that contours to your foot."]},{"header":"What''s new about the Vaporfly 3?","body":["An updated thin outsole rubber uses less material without sacrificing durability, which helps reduce outsole weight and thickness. This allows for extra millimetres of ZoomX foam underfoot and a smoother transition through your stride."]}],"product_details":[{"header":"Product details","body":["Weight: Approx. 165g (women''s size 6)","Heel-to-toe drop: 8mm","Wider toe area for a roomier fit","Internal foam pod on the heel for extra cushioning","Colour Shown: Sail/Crimson Tint/Guava Ice/Black","Style: DV4130-103","Country/Region of Origin: China"]}]}','https://static.nike.com/a/images/c_limit,w_592,f_auto/t_product_v1/18afc173-880b-492d-b619-4f5064189ac5/W+NIKE+ZOOMX+VAPORFLY+NEXT%25+3.png','830.74','2025-01-03 15:45:48.22583','2025-01-03 15:45:48.22583','running','women');
INSERT INTO public."PRODUCT" ("PRODUCT_ID","PRODUCT_NAME","PRODUCT_DESCRIPTION","PRODUCT_IMAGE","PRODUCT_PRICE","CREATED_AT","UPDATED_AT","PRODUCT_CATEGORY","GENDER") VALUES
	 ('159a125c-d185-4880-b136-321e39b49a7b','Nike Zegama 2','{"benefits":[{"header":"Kick up","body":["An inscription of one the trail''s gnarly switchbacks heading down to the Canyon is hand-drawn on the tongue tops. The sockliners are detailed with some of the South Kaibab''s more memorable trail markers and the ever-present mules. The pops of purple speak to the trail''s super-bright cacti."]},{"header":"Stay sticky","body":["Vibram Zegama outsole made with Vibram Megagrip has a diverse lug pattern highlighted with wide spacing. This means you get traction for more technical terrains."]},{"header":"Keep running","body":["A lightweight Nike ZoomX midsole is combined with increased stack heights to help provide cushioning during extended stretches of running."]},{"header":"Stable for trails","body":["Engineered mesh—stronger and more flexible than normal mesh—on the upper helps provide stability for various trail conditions."]}],"product_details":[{"header":"Product details","body":["Weight: 264g approx. (Women''s UK 5.5)","Heel-to-toe drop: 4mm","Not intended for use as personal protective equipment (PPE)","Colour Shown: Armoury Navy/Celestial Gold/Vintage Green/Metallic Silver","Style: FD5191-401","Country/Region of Origin: China"]}]}','https://static.nike.com/a/images/c_limit,w_592,f_auto/t_product_v1/6c1a7018-ca92-4442-b704-c74476d9177f/W+NIKE+ZOOMX+ZEGAMA+TRAIL+2.png','401.75','2025-01-03 15:45:48.226654','2025-01-03 15:45:48.226654','running','women'),
	 ('24e876ca-b59a-4ce0-bc3f-b7a9344132b9','Nike Interact Run EasyOn SE','{"benefits":[{"header":"Made from Nike Grind","body":["The Waffle outsole is made from at least 13% Nike Grind material, crafted from scraps from the footwear-manufacturing process."]},{"header":"Soft ride","body":["The soft, responsive foam in the midsole gives you a comfortable, smooth ride for your run and wherever else your day takes you. The high foam heights provide a soft feel."]},{"header":"Fly away","body":["The Flyknit upper has zones of breathability where your foot heats up most, specifically in the toe box. It''s strong and durable, helping keep your foot secure with every mile. The airy and breezy upper hugs your feet in a free and easy way."]}],"product_details":[{"header":"Product details","body":["Weight: 214 grams approx. (women''s UK 5.5)","Heel-to-toe drop: 10mm","Colour Shown: Black/Barely Volt/Multi-Colour/White","Style: HQ2698-001","Country/Region of Origin: Vietnam"]}]}','https://static.nike.com/a/images/c_limit,w_592,f_auto/t_product_v1/60efa759-2f57-4acb-b8d3-bd8de6fa4d2b/W+NIKE+INTERACT+RUN+EASYON+SE.png','456.93','2025-01-03 15:45:48.228247','2025-01-03 15:45:48.228247','running','women'),
	 ('1c493b37-98a0-47ab-a173-459ff75af5af','Nike Free RN NN','{"benefits":[{"header":"Made from Nike Grind","body":["The outsole has at least 13% Nike Grind material, made from scraps from the footwear manufacturing process.﻿"]},{"header":"Lightweight movement","body":["Flyknit gives you sock-like comfort with soft, stretchable and breathable fabric that helps keep you feeling light and airy when your run goes into overdrive. Inner sleeve is minimal but stretchy."]},{"header":"Soft in the middle","body":["An ultra-lightweight midsole offers unreal comfort as your foot repeatedly hits the road. It''s lighter, more responsive and softer than previous versions."]},{"header":"Stay secure","body":["Embroidered eyestays around the laces help keep your feet secure. Pull tabs at the tongue and heel make for an easy one-hand entry."]},{"header":"Added flexibility","body":["Laser-cut grooves on the sole make this shoe more flexible."]}],"product_details":[{"header":"Product details","body":["Not intended for use as Personal Protective Equipment (PPE)","Colour Shown: Lilac Bloom/Barely Grape/Vivid Purple/Black","Style: DX6482-500","Country/Region of Origin: Vietnam"]}]}','https://static.nike.com/a/images/c_limit,w_592,f_auto/t_product_v1/2bf6fcd2-6fd0-4cae-b956-3225789a35e1/W+NIKE+FREE+RN+FK+NEXT+NATURE.png','515.69','2025-01-03 15:45:48.228955','2025-01-03 15:45:48.228955','running','women'),
	 ('9cc15aeb-8a21-447f-a8b4-1d5022d7e404','Nike Run Swift 3','{"benefits":[{"header":"Cushion with Every Step","body":["Foam cushioning delivers a soft underfoot feel. A higher foam height gives you a plush sensation with every step."]},{"header":"Secure Fit","body":["Flywire cables help secure your feet and provide support when you tighten the laces, so you can stay stable."]}],"product_details":[{"header":"Product Details","body":["Heel overlay for added security","Mesh by the toe for breathability","Flex grooves on rugged rubber outsole for flexibility","Colour Shown: White/Pure Platinum/Metallic Silver","Style: DR2698-101","Country/Region of Origin: Vietnam"]}]}','https://static.nike.com/a/images/c_limit,w_592,f_auto/t_product_v1/8cb325cb-81c9-4b95-888f-f77cfcb8dab0/W+NIKE+RUN+SWIFT+3.png','796.99','2025-01-03 15:45:48.229608','2025-01-03 15:45:48.229608','running','women'),
	 ('ab04c15d-e8fb-4f37-b648-47a3d1949129','Nike Streakfly','{"benefits":[{"header":"Low and nimble","body":["A full-length ZoomX midsole provides optimal lightweight responsiveness. The foam stack heights are lower than the Vaporfly, saving weight and giving you a more aggressive feel. It results in a shoe so light it disappears on your foot, while still giving you the responsive cushioning of ZoomX foam, helping you reach your fastest pace throughout the turns and accelerations of any race."]},{"header":"Supportive and sleek","body":["An ultra-thin knit upper is light in weight while still providing the support you need for racing. Extra reinforcement in the forefoot helps keep you secure. The updated, sleek lacing system is laterally offset with a notched tongue to help relieve pressure on the top of the foot."]},{"header":"Grip where it counts","body":["Runner-informed data was used to create the outsole. It uses that information to place traction where you need it the most, with a pattern that connects to the pavement based on how your foot hits the ground. The result is solid grip from foot contact to toe-off, helping you stay ahead of the competition."]}],"product_details":[{"header":"Product details","body":["Weight: Approx. 185g (men''s size 9)","Heel-to-toe drop: 6mm","Colour Shown: Black/White/Sail/Metallic Gold Grain","Style: DJ6566-001","Country/Region of Origin: Vietnam"]}]}','https://static.nike.com/a/images/c_limit,w_592,f_auto/t_product_v1/84c1e0d5-ac53-4d7b-8991-f5d9a9cb3465/NIKE+ZOOMX+STREAKFLY.png','700.90','2025-01-03 15:45:48.231118','2025-01-03 15:45:48.231118','running','women'),
	 ('1365df80-fd00-4929-a442-29576ab910db','Nike Pegasus Trail 4 GORE-TEX','{"benefits":[{"header":"Storm Ahead","body":["A GORE-TEX layer helps keep out water so your feet stay dry. The all-new gaiter at the collar is higher to help keep extra debris and water from getting inside your shoe. GORE-TEX''s invisible fit along the upper provides protection from precipitation without sacrificing that comfortable feel of the Peg Trail. Its flexible, lightweight design keeps your foot dry when running between the wet roads and trails."]},{"header":"Smooth and Stable","body":["Nike React technology is a lightweight, durable foam that delivers a smooth, responsive ride. Its full-length design provides stability as you brave rocky terrain."]},{"header":"Traction In All Directions","body":["Less rubber along the outsole creates a smoother transition from road to trail. The rubber wraps around the front of the shoe for extra durability. Its generative traction pattern is combined with rubber nubs to give you grip when going uphill or downhill. A generative traction pattern combined with rubber provides extra grip for technical trails while maintaining a smooth ride for the road."]}],"product_details":[{"header":"Product details","body":["Weight: Approx. 227g (women''s size 6)","Heel-to-toe drop: 8.5mm","The inspirational message by the heel will vary between \"JUST DO IT\" and \"JUST RUN IT\", depending on the shoe","Pull loops on the heel and tongue","Not intended for use as personal protective equipment (PPE)","Colour Shown: Daybreak/Glacier Blue/Sundial/White","Style: DJ7929-502","Country/Region of Origin: Vietnam"]}]}','https://static.nike.com/a/images/c_limit,w_592,f_auto/t_product_v1/68c0c0c6-407f-4ebe-92dd-70fec1f503f4/W+REACT+PEGASUS+TRAIL+4+GTX.png','508.92','2025-01-03 15:45:48.231811','2025-01-03 15:45:48.231811','running','women'),
	 ('d85a52ad-4594-4b7a-930f-1fe6ae95a649','Nike Zoom Superfly Elite 2','{"benefits":[{"header":"Lightweight, Ready to Race","body":["Introducing the latest version of Flyknit—AtomKnit.Flyknit fabric is stretched, steamed and set, delivering a lightweight, contoured fit with minimal water absorption and enhanced breathability."]},{"header":"Tough Grip","body":["The plate''s design was created using data from hundreds of runners.The result is an outsole with increased stiffness and reduced weight.Peaks throughout the plate provide traction, giving your foot grip as you run around turns.It includes 8 removable stainless-steel pins to grip the track."]}],"product_details":[{"header":"Product Details","body":["Ideal for 100m–400m sprinters","World Athletics approved","Colour Shown: Racer Blue/Lime Blast/Safety Orange/White","Style: CD4382-400","Country/Region of Origin: China"]}]}','https://static.nike.com/a/images/c_limit,w_592,f_auto/t_product_v1/ab537277-cbf7-4ce0-98cf-f104427dd2c5/NIKE+ZOOM+SUPERFLY+ELITE+2.png','611.84','2025-01-03 15:45:48.232512','2025-01-03 15:45:48.232512','running','women'),
	 ('6ccc58d5-7a03-45f5-a7d2-22551b85e50a','Nike Free RN NN','{"benefits":[{"header":"Made from Nike Grind","body":["The outsole has at least 13% Nike Grind material, made from scraps from the footwear manufacturing process."]},{"header":"Lightweight Movement","body":["Flyknit gives you sock-like comfort with soft, stretchable and breathable fabric that helps keep you feeling light and airy when your run goes into overdrive. The inner sleeve is minimal but stretchy."]},{"header":"Soft in the middle","body":["An ultra-lightweight midsole offers incredible comfort as your foot repeatedly hits the road. It''s lighter, more responsive and softer than previous versions."]},{"header":"Stay Secure","body":["Embroidered eyestays around the laces help keep your feet secure. Pull tabs at the tongue and heel make for easy 1-hand entry."]},{"header":"Added flexibility","body":["Laser-cut grooves on the sole make this shoe more flexible."]}],"product_details":[{"header":"Product Details","body":["Not intended for use as Personal Protective Equipment (PPE)","Colour Shown: Black/Anthracite/White","Style: FB1276-002","Country/Region of Origin: Vietnam"]}]}','https://static.nike.com/a/images/c_limit,w_592,f_auto/t_product_v1/388d1fa1-5921-4181-9bf2-f37defd99521/NIKE+FREE+RN+FK+NEXT+NATURE.png','442.20','2025-01-03 15:45:48.096072','2025-01-03 15:45:48.096072','running','men'),
	 ('b687103c-553e-4ab5-ae59-450b15b054d9','Nike Zoom Bella 6','{"benefits":[{"header":"Vroom, vroom, Zoom","body":["A Zoom Air unit stretches from the heel to the midfoot, adding comfort to every step."]},{"header":"Revamped frame","body":["An updated frame in the forefoot creates more volume for an inclusive fit while maintaining confident shape and stance."]},{"header":"Stay solid","body":["Midfoot lacing enhances support without completely locking your foot into place. The flat sole helps keep you stable on gym surfaces."]},{"header":"Cool and Comfortable","body":["An inner sleeve improves ease of entry into the design while maintaining upper support. An ultra-cushioned collar keeps your ankle and heel comfortable and extends to the tongue."]}],"product_details":[{"header":"Product details","body":["Foam midsole","Pull tabs on heel and tongue","Colour Shown: Guava Ice/Pale Ivory/Red Stardust/Metallic Red Bronze","Style: DR5720-800","Country/Region of Origin: India"]}]}','https://static.nike.com/a/images/c_limit,w_592,f_auto/t_product_v1/8d3ebf63-9027-44db-8382-0e04ee623fa0/W+NIKE+ZOOM+BELLA+6.png','678.71','2025-01-03 15:45:48.14955','2025-01-03 15:45:48.14955','gym','women'),
	 ('d6b2ca10-7617-4549-9d8b-54dda69a6036','Nike Flex Experience Run 12','{"benefits":[{"header":"Plush upper","body":["The plush, super-soft upper hugs your foot and provides comfort."]},{"header":"Free to Move","body":["The grooves in the outsole allow for optimal foot flexibility and help you move freely when running the gamut."]},{"header":"Stable and supportive","body":["The low stack heights offer an enhanced lightweight design yet still provide the stability and support you need."]}],"product_details":[{"header":"Product details","body":["Not intended for use as personal protective equipment (PPE)","Colour Shown: Black/Dark Smoke Grey/White","Style: DV0746-004","Country/Region of Origin: Indonesia, Vietnam"]}]}','https://static.nike.com/a/images/c_limit,w_592,f_auto/t_product_v1/7d05075b-99bd-404c-a537-7f6e1b600674/W+FLEX+EXPERIENCE+RN+12.png','886.55','2025-01-03 15:45:48.165543','2025-01-03 15:45:48.165543','running','men');
